WEBVTT

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.340
Doctor...

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:06.000
Doctor!

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:10.480
<i>Looks like you've been
 teetering on the edge of a cliff.</i>

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.500
Circulation restored.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:14.020
Doctor...

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.130
Cardioplegia solution injected.

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.310
I'm so sorry...

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:17.820
I'm so sorry!

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:18.720
Hemostat!

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:21.820
Condition stabilized. 
Commencing resection.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.860
<i>It's time. Let's not linger here too long.</i>

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:24.310
Watch for VFib.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:30.500
I'm sorry... for making you suffer again.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.270
<i>She needs you.</i>

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.200
Doctor?

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.780
Doctor?!

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:39.890
Doctor!

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.410
Thank goodness... you're awake...

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:49.610
Long time no see... Doctor.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:50.610
It's Amiya.

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:54.070
We're finally here to bring you back.

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:58.920
Doctor?

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.860
What's wrong?

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:05.250
Can you... hear me?

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.520
Body temperature, blood pressure, and 
everything else is within normal ranges.

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:14.430
According to these numbers, 
physiological functions... all look good.

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:19.530
Amiya, there's an urgent call
 from Capt. Dobermann!

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:22.270
She ran into a group of militants, 
probably Reunion.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:27.420
She says to exfiltrate 
immediately and avoid contact.

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:29.320
What's Reunion doing here?

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:32.690
Maybe they're here for the Doctor—

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:36.000
No, they shouldn't know about the Doctor.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:40.680
Whatever their objective is, we have 
to avoid contact with them at all costs.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.150
Let's get out of here.

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:42.920
Roger!

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:42.920
Yes, ma'am!

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:46.010
I'm sorry you have to go through this now.

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:47.510
But we can't stay here.

00:01:47.510 --> 00:01:49.480
Let's get you changed and moving.

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:53.470
Doctor.

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.760
I'm so happy... to see you again.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:10.960
All clear.

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:17.990
Doctor, let's rest here a moment.

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:18.960
Amiya.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.420
I can't reach Capt. Dobermann.

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:26.680
She might have engaged Reunion already.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:28.810
We need to stay alert—

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:30.580
Doctor!

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:31.850
Are you okay?!

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.750
Your breathing is too shallow!
 Take deep breaths!

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:36.940
Doctor...

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.480
I'm sorry for pushing you this hard.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:42.570
I'll carry the Doctor. You two cover us.

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:44.110
Roger that.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:48.110
We have no idea where 
Reunion might be hiding.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:53.480
We have to be extra careful on 
our way to the rendezvous point.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.550
Doctor?

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.100
Doctor!

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:11.810
Take it easy. Calm your breathing.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.500
You don't have to say anything right now.

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:17.520
You can rest up properly
 once we're back on the ship.

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:19.530
It's okay.

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:21.820
Everything's okay.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:31.520
Reunion is covering the rendezvous point.

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:34.080
I don't see signs of a fight.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.100
We can't regroup there.

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:39.310
Head to the backup point.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:45.100
We'll search the area if 
we don't find Dobermann there.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:52.020
I hear footsteps. Turn back!

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.390
Someone's coming this way, too!

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.080
Who are you? What are you doing here?

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.260
Drop your weapons!

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:04.440
Who are you people? What are you doing here?

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:05.370
Start talking!

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:08.700
We are not your enemy.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.330
Please calm down.

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:14.140
Lies right off the bat, huh?

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:17.120
Search them head to tail. 
We're taking them in.

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:19.000
Get up!

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.290
Hey!

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.380
Guard!

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:23.700
No funny moves.

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:27.010
What?!

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:27.890
You basta—

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.950
Dobermann!

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:32.720
Sorry I'm late.

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:34.190
Is everyone okay?

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:35.730
Yes, we're fine.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:36.660
Over there!

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:37.400
Grab 'em!

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:38.350
Don't let 'em escape!

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:40.570
Looks like our friends 
downstairs heard the commotion.

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:42.750
I found a shortcut.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:43.480
Come with me.

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:48.360
It's lucky we managed to regroup.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:51.760
Yes. We rescued the Doctor, too.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:54.260
Now, we just need to make our way up.

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:58.280
About that... A large number of Reunion fighters
 have infiltrated the underground passage.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:02.020
They seem to be looking for something,
 but their objective is unclear.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:07.100
What is certain is they 
already see us as enemies.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:11.710
We have to assume they're guarding
 all the exits we planned to use.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:16.390
And there's no time to look for any 
other ways out. We will have to fight.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:20.270
Doctor, I've heard about your
 superior commanding skills.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:23.400
I'd like you to direct 
our extraction operation.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.570
Doctor, this is PRTS.

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:31.450
I'm sorry we're pushing you so hard.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:37.010
But with you in command, I'm sure 
we'll all make it above ground safely.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.850
Please, Doctor.

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:42.090
Help us.

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:44.440
<i>Please log in.</i>

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.200
Doctor...

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:50.720
I don't...

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:54.720
I don't... remember...

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:58.800
I don't remember... anything.

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:02.590
Who... am I?

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:04.410
I don't know...

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:11.290
I don't know who you are... either...

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:17.700
Hey now, what are you talking about? 
We don't have time for dumb jokes.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:20.630
I... I don't think that was a joke.

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:24.080
It's very rare, but I've heard
 reports of patients experiencing

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:27.710
memory issues after 
waking up from cold sleep.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.550
Is it treatable? 
How long does it take to recover?

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:33.720
I don't know. I'm sorry.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.000
You're kidding me.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.270
What about our Oripathy research? 
Does the Doctor remember that?

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:43.070
Amiya, this situation is 
far outside what we planned for.

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:45.320
We need a new strategy for this operation...

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:47.790
No, for all of Rhodes Island.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:49.230
Amiya, are you listening?!

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:51.610
We're fine.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.570
The Doctor will get us out of this.

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:59.540
What about this is "fine"?
 Our commander doesn't remember anything!

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:02.510
There might still be some memories in there.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:05.420
And we have no evidence 
the other memories won't come back—

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:08.980
I get where you're coming from, 
but you're being too optimistic.

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:14.550
No. We have to work
 with the manpower we've got.

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:18.060
Doctor.

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:22.560
You're very important to all of us.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:24.550
Don't worry.

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:27.750
You will remember everything.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:53.380
All clear.

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:56.270
I thought this place would be a no-go.

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:58.390
Was I overthinking it?

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:00.480
Are we getting through to Rhodes Island?

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:04.500
No response. The signal's still being jammed.

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:06.570
Should we move up?

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:09.860
Yes, but let's check out the 
situation above ground first.

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:12.130
The two of us will head outside.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.870
Everyone else, watch our six
 and wait for our signal.

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:17.210
Back...

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:21.080
Should... get back...

00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:22.750
Back?

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.870
You mean back underground?

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:26.040
No...

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:28.340
Those two...

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:29.970
are in danger.

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:31.810
Come back!

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:35.420
Damn it!

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:37.120
It's a trap!

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:41.110
We're falling back!

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:41.720
Cover us!

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:43.220
They're coming from below, too!

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:45.050
This way, too!

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:47.380
I'll hold them here!

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:48.690
<i>Can you... read me?</i>

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.510
Cover Capt. Dobermann!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:51.910
Amiya!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:54.160
<i>Ace... Come in...</i>

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:56.700
<i>This is Ace! Do you read me?!</i>

00:09:57.130 --> 00:09:59.320
Capt. Ace? Loud and clear!

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:02.630
<i>Look alive. Flashbang coming out.</i>

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:03.240
What?!

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:06.250
<i>On my signal, cover your eyes and ears.</i>

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:07.670
<i>Now!</i>

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:08.500
Doctor, get down!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.670
Procedure complete. You're okay now.

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:54.210
This is awful...

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:57.550
How could they do this to such a young girl?

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:02.180
I'm sorry we're using your
 shop without permission.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:06.180
Please let us rest here for a bit.

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:10.960
I wanted... to save you.

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:15.270
<i>Please log in.</i>

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:17.820
Doctor.

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:20.730
This is PRTS.

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:22.820
You can log in using your fingerprint.

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:27.290
It's our friend, and it'll give us 
all the information we need.

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:34.900
It's okay. There's no rush.

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:37.050
Try to remember it all a little at a time.

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:39.050
Everyone, listen up.

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:43.230
We've scouted the route to the secret 
shortcut and it's safe. We're leaving in ten.

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:45.150
Rest up until then.

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:49.750
Ace.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:50.600
Hey.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:54.650
It's been a long time... Doctor.

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:57.690
I hear you've got amnesia.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:02.480
Don't worry about it. 
As long as you're healthy.

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:06.950
We'll have lots of time to talk 
once we're back at Rhodes Island.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:12.040
I'm sorry, Capt. Dobermann. 
This happened because I let my guard down.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.670
No, the enemy caught us by surprise.

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:18.290
We made it out alive. That's good enough.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:23.550
According to the report from Scout's team, 
there are Reunion uprisings all over the city.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:28.020
Looting, riots, arson... the works.
 They're going nuts out there.

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:33.440
That's only going to see them
 ostracized even further...

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:38.440
Doctor, the ones who ambushed us
 are the Reunion Movement.

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:44.450
They're a terrorist organization formed by
 people infected with the "Oripathy" disease.

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:51.450
They started off just protesting 
the discrimination they faced...

00:12:51.860 --> 00:12:55.190
But they're finally showing
 their true colors, huh?

00:12:55.190 --> 00:13:00.960
They have to know the Ursus government 
isn't going to take this lying down.

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:04.000
Which means they think 
they can win in a fight.

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:09.490
Ursus security forces haven't quelled the 
unrest yet, which means they might be right.

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:12.310
Boy, did they throw a wrench in the works...

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:16.640
Thank you so much for the help, though.
 If you weren't there to check on—

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.680
I've had plenty of thanks already.

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:25.290
But why act now, when a Catastrophe's coming?

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:29.990
I wouldn't be surprised if they planned 
to take advantage in the commotion.

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:34.000
They'll get their revenge, 
even if it costs them their lives—

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.310
Don't let any of the Ursus escape!

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:39.270
They're all cold-blooded scumbags!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:43.800
It's time for them to get a taste of our pain!

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:45.010
How many?

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:46.920
About twenty.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.420
We should avoid fighting them.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:51.810
The enemy's coming from the left. 
Leave through the back door now.

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:56.660
Doctor.

00:13:58.510 --> 00:13:59.360
No...

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:00.810
No need.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:01.360
Huh?

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:07.050
I can... walk on my own.

00:14:19.470 --> 00:14:20.670
Not that way!

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:21.290
What's wrong?!

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:24.050
There's a mother and a child 
heading toward the Reunion!

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:26.930
If they're spotted, they'll be—

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:27.590
Wait!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:31.470
Taking so many head on
 will only lead to more death!

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:35.350
I know it's dangerous, 
but we can't just stand by!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.210
Do you get what's going on here, Amiya?!

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:41.610
If this drags on and we sustain more casualties, 
we won't be able to escape the Catastrophe!

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.200
<i>All</i> of us will die!

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:44.540
Calm down, Dobermann.

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:46.240
You're Rhodes Island's leader.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:50.550
And as its leader, you need to
 think about what to prioritize.

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:56.250
<i>Please log in.</i>

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.200
<i>Administrator.</i>

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:04.170
<i>Initializing... OK.</i>

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:06.880
<i>Permission: Level 8.</i>

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:10.260
<i>Welcome back, Doctor.</i>

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:12.500
It's okay.

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:14.800
<i>Deploying drones.</i>

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:15.430
Huh?

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:16.520
Wh-Whoa!

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.310
<i>Start searching for enemies.</i>

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:21.310
We can still save them...

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:23.240
We'll use the buildings.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:26.380
Doctor, you sure you can take command?

00:15:26.380 --> 00:15:29.770
Hold it. This is too much for you 
with your memories gone.

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:32.570
Doctor, please go ahead.

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.150
Amiya!

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:38.830
It was thanks to the Doctor that 
I stopped you two in time back there.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:39.880
What?

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:44.840
The Doctor's ability to observe and analyze 
our surroundings is as sharp as ever.

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:46.760
I'm sure of it.

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:50.840
The Doctor will lead us to victory.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.830
Let's do this.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:55.240
All right.

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:57.850
I'll trust you for now.

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:01.850
She's our leader. We don't really have a choice.

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:04.860
Thank you, all of you.

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:08.860
Silent we shall be if conflict is avoidable,

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:12.860
but we shall fight tooth and 
nail if we deem it necessary.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.990
We are Rhodes Island...

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:17.960
and that is our creed!

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:21.870
Found you!

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:22.970
Mama...

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:25.550
Time for you to pay for
 your sins with your life.

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:28.880
Please! Please let us go!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.710
<i>Mission start.</i>

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:32.680
At least spare my child!

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:36.080
You wish! Like hell we'll do that!

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:37.520
We'll <i>start</i> with the kid!

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:39.430
Hey, haven't you already killed enough?

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:41.840
Take your hands off me.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:47.440
What's wrong?! You all right?!

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:48.820
Phase 1.

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:52.650
It's the enemy!

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:53.860
Fire!

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:55.770
Phase 2.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:57.870
Drag them out!

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:04.570
What the...

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:06.180
Up there!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:07.640
Damn it!

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:09.380
Mama!

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:09.710
No!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:10.800
Shut up!

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.800
Cease firing, or you'll hit her, too!

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:17.800
Her Arts are black...
 She's no normal Caster.

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:19.810
She's just a kid!

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:22.640
Capture them all and bring them here!

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:24.100
Phase 3.

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:34.650
Damn you...

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:36.110
Th-They're...

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:39.120
What's happening? What the hell is this?!

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:43.000
You're no different from us!

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:44.910
Phase 4.

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:54.550
You're safe now.

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:57.050
<i>Target secured.</i>

00:17:58.400 --> 00:17:59.930
<i>Mission accomplished.</i>

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:08.810
Mama... Mama!

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.570
Don't worry.

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:11.820
What's wrong?

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:14.790
Dizziness when she tried to stand.

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:16.250
She'll be fine.

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:18.530
Thank goodness.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:21.840
Are you hurt?

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:23.350
Nope.

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:26.920
Your mommy will get better very soon.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:28.170
Really?

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:29.300
Really!

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:32.270
Excellent commanding, Doctor.

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:36.550
I apologize for being so rude before.
 You're a first-rate commander.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:41.550
Even with your memory gone, 
your body retained all of its experience, huh?

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:45.030
I'm not really sure myself...

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:46.250
No!

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:50.020
Don't touch my girl!

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:51.150
Mama?

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:55.630
Please listen. We can take
 you somewhere safe.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:58.710
You're infected, aren't you?

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:02.490
Thank you for saving us.

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:05.580
But please leave us alone.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:08.150
W-Wait!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:21.140
Please be sure... to find 
somewhere safe... to hide...

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:25.460
We've tended to everyone 
who needs treatment.

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:28.600
All right, let's get out of 
here before they come to.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:35.360
Thank you, Doctor.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:40.220
You got everyone through this alive.

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:50.390
We found them. Get the word out.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:55.310
That one...

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:56.750
Stay close.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:05.350
There's a park up ahead. We'll cut through
 and rendezvous with Nearl and Scout.

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:08.510
We'll go on ahead and scope things out.

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.060
Wait for us here.

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:16.220
Doctor.

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:20.150
Thanks for worrying about me.

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:22.540
I'm okay.

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:30.750
I guess I need to explain why
 that mother pushed us away.

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:36.640
We are Infected too, just like Reunion.

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:40.760
It's an infectious fatal 
disease, this Oripathy.

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:43.640
Our bodies slowly crystallize,

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:48.190
before eventually fracturing and
 spraying infectious dust into the air.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:50.520
There's still no cure for it.

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:56.110
I, Dobermann, and most of
 Rhodes Island's personnel are Infected.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:21:00.440
There is no recorded case 
of infection via bodily contact,

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:04.820
but most uninfected are
 afraid to come near us.

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:09.440
Discrimination and prejudice against
 the Infected exists in every country,

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:12.830
but we're especially shunned here in Ursus.

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:18.040
Using biased reporting, the Ursus government 
has instilled a psychological fear of Oripathy,

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:22.590
and most people here think 
the Infected should be exterminated.

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:28.080
Reunion launched its insurrection to exact 
revenge on those who had ostracized them.

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:32.980
Unless somebody puts a stop to it, 
this cycle of hatred will probably continue.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:41.030
Rhodes Island tries to help everyone 
affected by this disease, Infected or not,

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:45.290
and to solve all the
 problems caused by Oripathy.

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:50.450
We try to protect as many 
as we can from the fighting,

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:52.900
but that alone is not enough.

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:58.000
We need to find a cure for Oripathy 
and end the conflict at its source.

00:21:58.930 --> 00:22:02.540
And on that score, 
you're our shining hope, Doctor.

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:05.800
Before you lost your memories,

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:10.510
you were the leading expert on Oripathy,
 and you'd dedicated yourself to finding a cure.

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:15.640
If your research leads to 
a true cure for Oripathy,

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:18.520
it will free everyone from fear.

00:22:18.860 --> 00:22:21.220
You may not understand
any of this right now,

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:25.820
but there will come a day
 when you'll know what you must do.

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:27.290
<i>This is Ace.</i>

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:30.070
<i>Situation normal here. Take the tunnel.</i>

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:31.150
Roger.

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:32.280
Time to move.

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:35.810
What's wrong, Amiya?

00:22:36.280 --> 00:22:39.830
How long do we have until the
 Catastrophe swallows this city whole?

00:22:40.550 --> 00:22:42.030
About three hours.

00:22:42.030 --> 00:22:43.050
Let's get going.

00:22:44.030 --> 00:22:45.670
How are your injuries?

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:48.340
I've been worse.

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:50.280
Don't overdo it.

00:22:50.280 --> 00:22:51.240
Doctor.

00:22:53.730 --> 00:22:55.100
Thank you.

00:22:55.940 --> 00:23:00.730
If it wasn't for you, I would've 
given up on that girl and her mother.

00:23:02.450 --> 00:23:06.520
You're a Rhodes Islander, just like before.

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:09.650
And to me, you're a very...

00:23:13.260 --> 00:23:14.710
...a very important friend.

00:23:16.480 --> 00:23:18.000
Okay, let's go!
